  `afield.runtime.completion.FieldSuggestPresentationTest` drops; if it says so, run that test once. The written-up
  version, with the full sweep and the falsification behind it, is
  `dev_docs/completion_rank_at_scale.md`, and the saved document at
  `dev_docs/agents/demos/completion_rank_at_scale/` is this same scene.
operations:
